    "blurb": "Automate motor insurance claim handling",
    "overview": "Orchestrate motor insurance claims in Camunda with AI-assisted validation, document extraction, human approvals, and event-driven milestones from intake to payout.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Accelerate motor claim decisions with AI",
    "splashDescription": "This blueprint orchestrates the full motor insurance claim lifecycle in Camunda, from claim submission through final settlement. It starts with intake validation, policy checks, and duplicate detection, then routes claims into document collection and verification with controlled re-upload and clear rejection paths. AI assistance and intelligent document processing (IDP) capabilities extract and validate document data to reduce manual review effort and support more consistent decisions. Estimate handling is message-driven: survey images and estimates are submitted asynchronously and reviewed through surveyor and product expert decision gates, enriched with AI-based risk and pricing assessment context. The process then advances through repair coordination and inspection, followed by quality and settlement checks before closure. Throughout, role-based tasks, automated notifications, and explicit status transitions improve turnaround time, operational transparency, and auditability.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/783477/overview/img9263631825206968341.png?608ef054c677d90e962a1f6c16785d22",
